OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing fiancee after
OL,4,A'love bombing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted stabbing and killing
OL,7,Fhis fiancee at her home in Leeds after
OL,8,F"love bombing" her, West Yorkshire
OL,9,FPolice has said.
OL,11,FJack Johns pleaded guilty to murdering
OL,12,FMalgorzata Wiktor, also known as Gosia,
OL,13,Fat Leeds Crown Court earlier.
OL,15,FThe 52-year-old had been in a
OL,16,Frelationship with Gosia, 51, for about
OL,17,Fsix months before he attacked her at
OL,18,Fher house in Foster Square, Belle Isle,
OL,19,Fin June.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
