OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing fiancee after
OL,4,A'love bombing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohns, of School Street in Tingley, has
OL,7,Fbeen remanded into custody and will be
OL,8,Fsentenced on 9 November.
